  - m_Id: 693841467764736
    m_Localized: Skip cutscene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694073899315200
    m_Localized: 'Society was on the brink of disaster: pollution, corruption and
      disease plagued the planet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694233647771648
    m_Localized: Until a giant organism, the Mother Plant, rose from chaos spreading
      its spores across all continents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694251003801600
    m_Localized: The spores caused fauna and flora to mutate in mysterious ways,
      but they were lethal to humans if inhaled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694274424795136
    m_Localized: Thus, humanity was forced to live underground and create a new way
      of life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694302065258496
    m_Localized: We the hunters, a selected group of individuals, promised to reach
      the base of the Mother Plant and destroy it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694337993666560
    m_Localized: No one has found success yet, as the obstacles are formidable, but
      we will never give up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
